cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use these summaries, reproductions or tools, please cite the
  repository. If you are citing a paper I summarised, cite the paper — the
  summary is my reading of it, not a source for its claims.
title: "research-notebook"
abstract: >-
  A public research notebook: paper summaries written in my own words,
  reproductions of published results, reading lists and small tools, across
  medical imaging, computer vision, foundation models, multimodal AI, AI
  systems and machine-learning theory.
type: software
authors:
